<title>INDIA: India Dr Reddy's 96/97 results on May 17.</title>
<headline>India Dr Reddy's 96/97 results on May 17.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmaceuticals firm Dr Reddy's Laboratories Ltd said on Friday its board meets on May 17 to finalise accounts and recommend dividend for the year ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>The firm had raised $48 million through a global depositary receipts issue in 1994.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
